    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, TOR 1",
        "text": "Casey Mittelstadt scored on the power play at 6:31, from Mason Lohrei and JJ Peterka, for a 1–0 lead. David Pastrnak left the bench with about six minutes left in the period, and the Bruins announced a lower-body injury before the second. Morgan Rielly's wrist shot from the point, through traffic in front of Jeremy Swayman, tied it 1–1 at 16:53."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 1, TOR 2",
        "text": "Toronto lost defenseman Chris Tanev to a lower-body injury after a collision with Mark Kastelic three minutes in. Rielly scored again off a faceoff win in Boston's zone with 2:04 left, the 100th goal of his career, for a 2–1 lead."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 1, TOR 3",
        "text": "Boston got one shot on a 5-on-3 that lasted 1:58 early in the period. Colton Sissons made it 3–1 at 7:24, from Gavin McKenna, and Anthony Stolarz shut the door the rest of the way."
      }
    ],
